This <University of Oxford> Part C paper combines Methods of <Functional> Analysis for PDEs in section A with <Fixed Point> Methods for Nonlinear PDEs in section B. https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/maths_past_papers_3[Source release]{ref} The archive preserves the full editable seven-page paper. <Bounded> official-source searches found no advertised answers for this exact paper. Question 3 has a missing spectral term in one printed adjoint weak-form assertion; the solution gives a counterexample and the corrected derivation.

